  // (lyricsMap/instrumentMap/percussionMap) whose rows and options depend on
  // the current document, not a fixed schema - too dynamic for a FieldDef,
  // so they're appended via each group's renderExtra instead. See
  // convertAndRenderMusicXml() further below for how all of this actually
  // reaches toMusicXml()/toMidi(). ---

