  // lyricsMap/instrumentMap/percussionMap choices persist separately from
  // the FieldDef-driven `overrides` above: their keys are document content
  // (a lyric part id, an instrument name, a sound code), not a fixed field
  // path, so they don't fit loadOverrides/saveOverrides' per-field
